---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Spell Check is Global : The Future of Computer Intelligence in the hands of the many (7B+) and not the few (under 500M)"
  description="About: Spell Check is Global : The Future of Computer Intelligence in the hands of the many (7B+) and not the few (under 500M). History essay in the OpenIE research catalog."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">History essay · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Spell Check is Global : The Future of Computer Intelligence in the hands of the many (7B+) and not the few (under 500M)
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      A history essay. People paid a premium for spell check. Then it could not be sold. It is free, and it is bundled into the editor, the browser, and the phone. Dated prices, the local library in every editor, and the bundling economics behind the lost price.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      Technology built for global access reaches more than 7 billion people. Scarcity pricing keeps a capability with fewer than 500 million. The two numbers frame a choice. They are not a census. Energy to run is what remains.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2" id="companion-laws">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Companion papers</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        Research papers: <a href="/papers/agency/" class="text-brand-cyan">Thermodynamic Bounds and an Optimal Tempo for Goal-Holding Agents</a> ·
        <a href="/papers/gates/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metered Commit Gates</a> ·
        <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="text-brand-cyan">Task Satiation vs. Aggregate Rebound</a>.
        Essay: <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="text-brand-cyan">Spell Check is Global</a>.
        Product white papers, kept apart: <a href="/products/mei/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metabolic Intelligence</a> · <a href="/products/jouleos/" class="text-brand-cyan">The Search for JouleOS</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper → /papers/spellcheck/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/spellcheck.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/spellcheck/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Interactive figures
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
